window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-066-a59dda59cfff590b.json"]={sha256:"a59dda59cfff590bb21308c485e87e6a16ef4046fe6b51ad4a8dbd3601c1b58d",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-7a5bed2fb848484a","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5424","title":"RFC 5424: The Syslog Protocol","titleEn":"RFC 5424: The Syslog Protocol","publisher":"RFC Editor / IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-066","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-066","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-067","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8639"],"title":"YANG 通知訂閱：推送負載與訂閱生命週期","titleEn":"YANG notification subscriptions: load and lifecycle","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：第5項研究的可複查條件：接受PRI可逆及原文保留；不可把未標時區時間自動當本地正確時間。 交接時須能核對：交付 syslog-fields.csv、分類測試與時區缺漏標記。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Investigation 5 review criterion: Require reversible PRI parsing and raw retention; an unlabeled zone is not automatically valid local time. Handover must also reconcile: Deliver syslog-fields.csv, classification tests and missing-zone flags.","difference":"以subscription ID、filter、狀態與event time建帳本，終止後不得繼續累加事件。","differenceEn":"Ledger subscription ID, filter, state and event time; terminated subscriptions must stop generating records.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["Syslog PRI把facility與severity編碼成整數；訊息文字的嚴重字眼不是正式severity欄位。\n教學基準：16*8+3 = 131 PRI；對照：16*8+6 = 134 PRI。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","訂閱式通知有建立、修改、終止及錯誤狀態；推送傳輸成功不代表應用已處理。\n教學基準：120/2*800 = 48000 B/s mean；對照：120/5*800 = 19200 B/s mean。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Syslog PRI encodes facility and severity; alarming words in text are not the formal severity field.\nTeaching baseline: 16*8+3 = 131 PRI; comparison: 16*8+6 = 134 PRI. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","Notification subscriptions have establish, modify, terminate and error states; transport delivery does not prove application processing.\nTeaching baseline: 120/2*800 = 48000 B/s mean; comparison: 120/5*800 = 19200 B/s mean. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-076","referenceUrls":["https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-450-principles-of-digital-communications-i-fall-2006/"],"title":"Armstrong FM：Carson 頻寬與偏移取捨","titleEn":"Armstrong FM: Carson bandwidth and deviation tradeoff","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：第5項研究的可複查條件：接受PRI可逆及原文保留；不可把未標時區時間自動當本地正確時間。 交接時須能核對：交付 syslog-fields.csv、分類測試與時區缺漏標記。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Investigation 5 review criterion: Require reversible PRI parsing and raw retention; an unlabeled zone is not automatically valid local time. Handover must also reconcile: Deliver syslog-fields.csv, classification tests and missing-zone flags.","difference":"能推導並解釋144000 Hz與84000 Hz，建立fm_budget.csv、調變指數表、頻譜遮罩待驗項，並完成以下驗收：教學可用頻寬100 kHz時第二組滿足近似預算；仍須另驗濾波、失真與遮罩。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 144000 Hz and 84000 Hz; create fm_budget.csv, modulation-index table and pending spectral-mask checks; apply this acceptance decision: With a100 kHz teaching allocation, only the second case fits the approximation; filtering, distortion and masks require separate checks.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["Syslog PRI把facility與severity編碼成整數；訊息文字的嚴重字眼不是正式severity欄位。\n教學基準：16*8+3 = 131 PRI；對照：16*8+6 = 134 PRI。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","從原理 Carson近似B=2(deltaf+fm)估計FM主要能量頻寬；它不是精確頻譜遮罩或合規判定。 展開基準式 2*(60000+12000)；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：分別求調變指數5與2.5，再以2fm(beta+1)重算；不得把峰值偏移當峰對峰值。 將兩條推導一起存入 fm_budget.csv、調變指數表、頻譜遮罩待驗項。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Syslog PRI encodes facility and severity; alarming words in text are not the formal severity field.\nTeaching baseline: 16*8+3 = 131 PRI; comparison: 16*8+6 = 134 PRI. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","Starting from Carson approximation B=2(deltaf+fm) estimates dominant FM bandwidth; it is not an exact spectral mask or compliance test., expand baseline expression 2*(60000+12000); record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Compute modulation indices5 and2.5, then cross-check with2fm(beta+1); peak deviation is not peak-to-peak deviation. Save both derivations with fm_budget.csv, modulation-index table and pending spectral-mask checks.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-e2624336c5420a6c","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8639","title":"RFC 8639: Subscription to YANG Notifications","titleEn":"RFC 8639: Subscription to YANG Notifications","publisher":"RFC Editor / IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-12394b4a22706b67","url":"https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-450-principles-of-digital-communications-i-fall-2006/","title":"Principles of Digital Communications I","titleEn":"Principles of Digital Communications I","publisher":"MIT OpenCourseWare","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
